WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.200
A quick update from an extension can be useful
while you’re getting your next prompt ready.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.063
You check for changes in a clean project.

3
00:00:10.063 --> 00:00:13.764
The result shows in a card in
the top right. Keep typing,

4
00:00:13.764 --> 00:00:18.440
and the card disappears while the
prompt you started stays where it was.

5
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.749
When an extension has
something brief to tell you,

6
00:00:28.749 --> 00:00:31.640
you can read it and carry
on from the same place.
